('d-outcomes-slice-keys-college-set-s670','decision','A course outcomes slice is keyed by the colleges it read','S670: kb/_course_outcomes_load.py read_files keeps one slice per (college set, part, of); a college re-read in a different number of parts keeps only its newest split. Before it, Coastline''s 2-part objectives read displaced Golden West''s slices in any unfiltered cccd load. No row was lost: loads only insert. Guards: objectives test check 19, load test check 9 (#3420).',array['program-requirements-harvest','course-outcomes','decision'],'proposed','#3420; COBIx on #3420',null,null,'SkyBunting (S670)',date '2026-11-17'),
('d-skyline-yield-one-live-row-s670','decision','Skyline yield: one of six dropped records held a live row','S670: #3423 dropped six Skyline records read from another program''s page (46296, 32337, 31587, 39658, 45668, 32479). A live read found only 32337 held a program_requirement_records row; a guarded delete removed it, its full image in kb/receipts/program_requirement_records_before_skyline_32337_s670.json, rollback beside the migration (#3436).',array['program-requirements-harvest','slice-a','decision'],'proposed','#3436; migration run 44009832772',null,null,'SkyBunting (S670)',date '2026-11-17'),
('p-read-live-rows-before-guarded-delete-s670','procedure','Read the live rows before writing a guarded delete','S670: a handoff''s removal list names records, not rows. Read the live rows once (one batched read), write the delete to match exactly the rows found on key, page and run, raise on any other count, and file each row''s full image as the receipt. Skyline''s list of six held one live row: the failing records had never loaded.',array['program-requirements-harvest','rule-10','procedure'],'proposed','#3436',null,null,'SkyBunting (S670)',date '2026-11-17'),
('p-apply-merge-takes-mains-copy-s670','pitfall','Resolve a kb/migrations/.apply conflict to main''s copy','S670: when two branches each named a migration, merging main into the second branch must resolve kb/migrations/.apply to main''s copy. Keeping the branch''s own copy makes the push differ from main and re-run its migration; a guarded delete then raises on zero rows. The applied file stays in kb/migrations/ with its receipt.',array['supabase-migrate','rule-10','pitfall'],'proposed','#3436',null,null,'SkyBunting (S670)',date '2026-11-17'),
('f-coastline-objectives-loaded-s670','milestone','Coastline objectives loaded, 522 rows','S670: Coastline''s objectives reread (read 43984094171, 555 pages, 522 courses with objectives, 4,097 statements) loaded 522 objective rows (load 44006629705, error none, SLO rows held back), #3420. Golden West is the next objectives reread on cccd. Diablo Valley''s trial parsed 11 of 12 and moves to its full read.',array['program-requirements-harvest','course-outcomes','milestone'],'proposed','#3420; kb/receipts/course_outcomes_cccd_44006629705.json',null,null,'SkyBunting (S670)',date '2026-11-17')
